Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:29.37,Hook,,0,0,0,,¿ESTO ES UN\NVIDEOJUEGO?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Miren, uno del chat dice\Nque Rockstar
